{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_237_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_237","textTraditional":"一、十年。春王二月，邾婁子益來奔。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_237_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_237","textTraditional":"二、公會吳伐齊。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_237_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_237","textTraditional":"三、三月戊戌，齊侯陽生卒。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_237_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_237","textTraditional":"四、夏，宋人伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_237_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_237","textTraditional":"五、晉趙鞅帥師侵齊。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_237_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_237","textTraditional":"六、五月，公至自伐齊。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_237_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_237","textTraditional":"七、葬齊悼公。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_237_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_237","textTraditional":"八、衞公孟彄自齊歸于衞。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_cdt_237_9","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_237","textTraditional":"九、薛伯寅卒。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_cdt_237_10","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_237","textTraditional":"十、秋，葬薛惠公。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_cdt_237_11","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_237","textTraditional":"十一、冬，楚公子結帥師伐陳。吳救陳。","sentenceOrder":11}],"overrides":{}}